## Interface: 16001
## Title: WoWderhoi AHelper
## Notes: Auction house scanner and price intelligence for WoW: Forever (Infinite) 1.60.1 and retail 12.x. Port of the TBC Anniversary build to the C_AuctionHouse API. 0.3.1: main-city scan reliability (60s start watchdog, no 0-item false success, stream-growth + stall handling). 0.3.2: auto-retry the replication when the first request is silently dropped. 0.3.3: replication start timeout raised to 3 min. 0.3.4: chart window shows only while the auction house is open; normal tooltips (merchant/bags/links) keep price info only.
## Author: Jim Zhang
## Version: 0.3.4
## Category: Auctions
## Category-zhCN: 拍卖
## SavedVariables: WoWderhoiAHDB
# Interface 16001 = WoW: Forever client 1.60.1 (shares the retail 12.x UI
# architecture, incl. C_AuctionHouse). Add 120xxx values here if the retail
# client must load it too; Forever only reads the value that matches its own
# client build. If the client flags the addon as out of date, set this number
# to the version shown under the launcher's Play button.

